Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found Dalton over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible. I\Ncan't feel a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prepared this extra nutritious and\Nfortifying meal just for you so we can
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get a healthy smile back on that beautiful\Nface of yours thank you Sanji of course
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although you're as heartbreakingly\Ngorgeous as ever in spite of your painful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ordeal Hey you I don't recall you asking\Nfor permission to use my kitchen Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a dish for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.05,0:02:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to make you look years...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a swinging single\Nstill in the prime of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a day over 139, right? Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lee, save me from this loaded tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's gonna join\Nus and be our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I was going to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.41,0:03:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he only knew what friend means to\Nsomeone who's been through what Chopper has.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Chopper was out there on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was only one human that\Nhe ever really opened up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man's name was Dr. Hiriluk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a crazy quack, but he named\NChopper and called him his son.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.97,0:03:49.94,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H141414&\c&H141414&\bord2.1\pos(720,710)\fad(1360,0)\blur0.5\1a&HFF&\t(1315,1360,\1a&H00&)}Quack Doctor
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.97,0:03:49.94,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(720,710)\fad(1360,0)\c&HE6E6E6&\blur0.5\4a&HFF&}Quack Doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He beats me, and he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy quack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.91,0:04:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are Lord Waple's\Norders. Now move out! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to call a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no doctors left to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for the 20 mds who belong to Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we have to beg Wapol on our knees\Nfor help then that's what we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need waple's charity.
