Dialogue: 3,0:04:35.78,0:04:40.24,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\pos(720,780)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\fscx77.9\fscy95\fad(474,0)\c&HFDFEFE&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Dr. Hiriluk, Quack Doctor{Zenef}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll examine him. Here, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the last bunch of patients you\Ntreated ended up getting a whole lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no need to\Nbe shy with your doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just developed a wonderful\Nnew old-purpose drug yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not the kind\Nof gun you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.97,0:05:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tranquilizer gun for\Npatients with severe pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get the soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go! If you want\Nmoney, I'll be glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to pay I don't take\Nmoney from sick people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to help you don't do\Nit please I'm too young to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh okay I gotta admit\NI wasn't expecting that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have made a mistake\Nwith the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I shouldn't have used frog extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry there. My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pyrrha, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.48,0:05:55.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\pos(720,780)\c&H000000&\bord3.8\blur0.5\fscx75.05\fscy90.25\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,480,\1a&H00&)\t(3900,4380,\1a&HFF&)}Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old){Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:51.48,0:05:55.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\pos(720,780)\bord0.5\blur0.1\fscx75.05\fscy90.25\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\3c&HFDFEFE&\c&HFDFEFE&\1a&HFF&\t(0,480,\1a&H00&)\t(3900,4380,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old){Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:51.48,0:05:55.86,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\pos(720,780)\c&HFDFEFE&\bord0\blur0.5\fscx75.05\fscy90.25\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\4a&HFF&}Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old){Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now? Quack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:05:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunt has reached its final stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you and I are the only\Nones left in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol has his hunters desperately\Nlooking for us everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if they weren't, you'd\Nalready be a pariah in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're the worst quack of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to get caught\Nby some fool doctor hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one day I'll end up saving\Nthis country with medical science.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.09,0:06:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you mean destroy this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there are people on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around, quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if I see you first,\Nyou thieving sawbones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those tin soldiers\Naren't gonna capture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go on helping\Nthe sick and the injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:07:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stop the bleeding\Nright away or you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Yeti! Shoot it dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're pretty lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I just created an ointment three\Ndays ago that even works on broken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let that Blue\NMoose Yeti get away, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill him before he kills us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.97,0:07:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look like a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be that Yeti everyone\Nis talking about in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.51,0:07:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough. Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're\Ndealing with, creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not gonna shoot you, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Hiriluk, Dr. Hiriluk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.51,0:08:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wanna help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pretty good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to go to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I wonder if I am doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the first encounter\Nbetween Chopper and Dr. Hiriluk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what happened next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between Chopper and Dr. Hiriluk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you kept silent?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd hate me if I talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I talked to humans the\Nother day, they shot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, people think\NI'm a freak for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can talk, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even children learn to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see what's damn special about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, I thought for sure that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least your head was\Nbandaged to begin with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.07,0:10:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you call me Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your new name, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I picked it because I\Nthought you'd look like you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could chop down a tree with\Nthose antlers of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's what I'm going to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always pay close attention\Nto your patient's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,symptoms and give them proper treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way to save a person's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are sick people who need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.03,0:11:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you crazy clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.71,0:11:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever come back! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Waffle's guards! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, it's time to use the decoy plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wood plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost got me killed,\Nyou maniac! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already cheated death once,\Nyou clumsy Pluto's caribou?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's reindeer and don't call me Pluto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, that's the first time\NI've ever fought with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to have an opponent to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is it your first time for this as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.59,0:12:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for you. A gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a memento of our making up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Chopper, it sometimes\Nfeels that things are pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But try not to hold a grudge\Nagainst us humans, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country is sick right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people and the king both suffer\Nfrom a terrible sickness of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The conventional wisdom has it that\Nthere is no way to cure a sick country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.85,0:12:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once my invention has been perfected,\Nthis country will be as good as saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, there used to be a master thief\Nwho lived in a country in the far west.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a serious heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went to the greatest doctors he\Ncould find to receive treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no one was able to cure him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told him he was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frustrated and depressed, he\Npassed by a certain mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he saw something\Nhe had never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blossoms!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw cherry blossoms\Nall over the mountainside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he went to see another doctor and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got the shock of his\Nlife because he was told,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.79,0:13:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was cured. It was a\Nmiracle. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it also makes perfect\Nsense medically speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By changing his emotional state,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was able to change his\Nphysical state somehow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that's true, there's no disease\Nin this world that can't be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them laugh at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My medical skills will\Nsave this country yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why I raised\Nthis skull and cross bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a challenge to all the\Ndiseases of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.41,0:14:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This symbolizes my belief\Nthat nothing is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will save this country\Nwith my doctor's skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By raising this flag, I vow to\Nfight just like the pirates do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join us and be our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Booty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't be a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, what are pirates? Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dashing\Nswashbucklers of the sea with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great strength and the eyesight of eagles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their voices echo like rolling thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.31,0:14:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're really a pirate? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I've been saying all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do all kinds of fun stuff,\Nlike fishing and singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.13,0:15:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sometimes we dance, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call that being a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we go on adventures. You really do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates really do go on adventures?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates risk their lives\Nto go on adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you meet the most amazing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most amazing people sail the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, someday you've got to go to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll realize just how\Nsmall your problems really
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are in comparison to the\Nvastness of the oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island you were born on is\Nlike this compared to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's smaller, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your destiny lies beyond that shining sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good times passed in\Nthe twinkling of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it finally came time to say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.27,0:16:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as it always does in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.67,0:16:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's taken a year but your\Ntreatment is finally complete.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\pos(720,780)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\bord3.6\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)}One Year Later
Dialogue: 2,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.68,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\pos(720,780)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&}One Year Later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your injuries are healed chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your way, have a nice life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm busy with my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hit the bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.67,0:16:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer under any\Nobligation to care for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I swear I won't cause you any\Ntrouble if you'll just let me stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll rub your shoulders every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you tea and clean the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.29,0:16:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anywhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hurt my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to sea if you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go anywhere you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are. Tell me the truth.\NHow many days do I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me this isn't a charity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ward you don't have the\Nmoney to pay my fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill a person with\Na tranquilizer gun you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.17,0:18:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.01,0:18:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten days from now, you'll\Ndie, so now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.62,0:18:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In two days, my research will be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now completed, after failing for 30 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make cherry blossoms\Nbloom in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, you've wasted 30 years\Nresearching freaking cherry blossoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.97,0:18:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what your big project has been?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same cherry blossoms you think saved
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your life back when you\Nwere a master thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a winter island where\Nit's bitter cold year-round.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No cherry blossom will ever bloom here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was nothing but a worthless criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the very brink of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but those flowers saved my life\Nand transformed my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every human being in\Nthis world can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.97,0:19:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to prove it right here\Nin Drum, the land where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize that what\Nyou're saying has no basis
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in medical science or any\Nother field of science,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if you do get them to bloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.73,0:19:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no medicinal use.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.39,0:19:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you and I are alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So before I die, I'll at least teach you\Nthat nothing is impossible in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that you can do anything if you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the story of these two outcasts\Ndoesn't have a happy fairy tale ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That scent. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he found out Hiriluk\Nonly had 10 days to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper got very upset,\Nas you might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then he decided to take\Naction the only way he knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I will make\Ncherry blossoms bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.31,0:20:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This symbolizes my belief\Nthat nothing is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight like pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why have so many\Nguards been missing lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the 20MDs have them\Nout picking mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.89,0:21:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushrooms? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The doctors think there's some kind\Nof mushroom that can cure anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they've got the other\Nguards out looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll spot us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.19,0:21:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, did you hear what they said?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not going to shoot you, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.03,0:21:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go where you want, but don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a terrible thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least you'll\Nsee my cherry blossoms!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be my last great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.33,0:22:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is impossible for a\Nman who raises the pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.43,0:23:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what I told you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.93,0:23:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.39,0:23:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it, the amyudaki mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.69,0:23:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I get across?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:02.36,0:24:04.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\pos(720,780)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\bord3.6\fscx95\fscy95\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)}One Week Later{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:24:02.36,0:24:04.53,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\pos(720,780)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&\fscx95\fscy95}One Week Later{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.17,0:24:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.93,0:24:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I lost one\Nof your precious books.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.29,0:24:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good Lord, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.13,0:24:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An amyadaki mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.29,0:24:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Liv.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.23,0:24:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.37,0:24:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please teach me to be a doctor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.05,0:25:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight and I won't\Ngive up, just like pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.77,0:25:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chumper, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.99,0:25:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think a reindeer can?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.33,0:25:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.29,0:25:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.89,0:25:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be a wonderful doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.35,0:25:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you'll be a wonderful doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.15,0:25:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you have such a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.27,0:25:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chess!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.45,0:25:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuromariimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.69,0:25:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is hunting the doctors\Nproceeding according to my plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.87,0:25:37.54,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord3.5\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\4a&HFF&\fscx95\fscy95\pos(720,726)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)}King Wapol\NDrum
