Dialogue: 3,0:25:42.29,0:25:45.48,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,730)\fad(480,0)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx82.5\fscy82.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\4a&HFF&}Dalton\NDrum Royal Guard Captain{Ravenfire/PJ/Gaijin}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.55,0:25:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two that still elude us, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old crone, Dr. Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.01,0:25:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that crazy quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.43,0:25:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I just had a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send a notice to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.99,0:26:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them that the 20 MDs\Nhave all fallen gravely ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.61,0:26:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's the mushroom soup? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.17,0:26:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, this reeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.15,0:26:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No living creature could eat this soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.61,0:26:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.59,0:26:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.47,0:26:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good medicine never tastes good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.97,0:26:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just means it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the soup, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.91,0:26:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.13,0:26:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.87,0:26:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.89,0:26:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.15,0:26:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting 30 years for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've done it chopper my\Nresearch is a success
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.17,0:27:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i was right all along see that see that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.23,0:27:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't do it i can make cherry\Nblossoms bloom on this winter island
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.05,0:27:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going out, but you stay put\Nand rest. Okay. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.01,0:27:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor was happy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.87,0:27:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I cured a human's disease
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.99,0:27:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to become a great\Ndoctor. I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.93,0:27:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize this entire country is a\Nmadhouse right now. Yeah, I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you heard about the 20 mds falling\Nill what a crock so what brings you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.07,0:28:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here today i have a favor to ask i\Nrefuse anything else i haven't even
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.19,0:28:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,asked it yet so what is this dust\Nsupposed to be that dust is 30 years of my
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.83,0:28:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life it's the discovery i've been\Nsearching for it'll treat this country's
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.81,0:28:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sickness and it'll cure it you just\Nwasted 30 years of your life nicely
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.49,0:28:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,done anyway why are you showing it to\Nme i wasn't able to make enough dust
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no time i want you to make\Ncherry blossoms bloom for me nonsense
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.21,0:28:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why should i waste my finished i want\Nyou to teach chopper about medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.03,0:28:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wants to be a doctor more than\Nanything are you mad he may be a reindeer
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.73,0:28:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a freak but I know he'll make a\Ngreat doctor. He's a good person with
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.57,0:28:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a kind heart he risked his life to\Nmake medicine for me please help him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.13,0:28:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,become a doctor you've sure got a lot\Nof nerve you quack why should I take
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care of your half-baked research and\Nyour weird bet you know me I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.59,0:29:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the type to get all sentimental just\Nbecause someone has a short time to
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live now, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.99,0:29:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my tree yeah I
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know we've known each other a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.55,0:29:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goodbye this doesn't seem\Nlike you here look to
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.21,0:29:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up so easily? I'm almost out\Nof time. No, he couldn't. I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.89,0:29:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.37,0:29:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20MDs are ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.09,0:29:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who will treat the country's sick people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.05,0:29:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least give us medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.55,0:29:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good talking to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.81,0:29:35.36,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,799)\fscx90\fscy90\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)}Ropeway Station Four
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.81,0:29:35.36,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\fad(480,0)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,799)\fscx90\fscy90\4a&HFF&}Ropeway Station Four
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.23,0:29:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.14,0:29:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.53,0:29:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.03,0:29:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gun's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.65,0:29:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head for the ropeway, then the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.81,0:29:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that damn fool hero look?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud,\Nyou don't have to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.89,0:29:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.41,0:29:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where'd that quack run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.37,0:29:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.55,0:29:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D-Doctor got better, so he went\Ninto town. That's all. Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.01,0:30:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.29,0:30:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His condition can't be cured by any\Ntreatment known to modern medical science.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.65,0:30:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.75,0:30:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.05,0:30:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all better now, because\NI gave him this to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.91,0:30:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.67,0:30:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an all-purpose\Nmedicine, so he's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.81,0:30:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he felt like\Nhe was full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.79,0:30:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor said he was going\Nto teach me to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.15,0:30:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.99,0:30:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.91,0:30:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.55,0:30:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.27,0:30:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.41,0:30:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you eat it, you're\Ndead in half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.99,0:30:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why that idiot came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.33,0:30:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.19,0:31:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked in one of Doctor's books.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.73,0:31:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I guess I lost the book somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.33,0:31:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can defeat all diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.71,0:31:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I raised this flag as a challenge\Nto all the diseases of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.77,0:31:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.69,0:31:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a skull next to the\Npicture of the Amiodaki mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.57,0:31:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Doctor said he got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.35,0:31:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.29,0:31:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.45,0:31:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop dawdling!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.91,0:31:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.55,0:31:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't got any time left to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.45,0:31:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was touched by the\Nkindness in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.25,0:31:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skull in that book\Nmeans poison, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.77,0:31:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.71,0:31:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no known medicine in this\Nworld that can work for all diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.75,0:31:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why doctors exist. But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.75,0:31:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you can't save\Npeople with just kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.17,0:31:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want to save them,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.85,0:31:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need medical skills and\Nthe training to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.71,0:31:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without that you can't save anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.75,0:32:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.21,0:32:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wapol, Hiriluk is\Nheaded towards the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.95,0:32:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.01,0:32:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.05,0:32:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he serious? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.41,0:32:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.41,0:32:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never return to this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.87,0:32:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he chose the\Ncastle to be his tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.73,0:32:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand that you take me to the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come to save the 20 MDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.57,0:32:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.15,0:32:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.73,0:32:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.17,0:32:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20 MDs are fine, as you can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.89,0:32:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only life in danger\Nhere is yours, Dr. Hiriluk!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.11,0:33:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.53,0:33:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guards! Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.99,0:33:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.23,0:33:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.69,0:33:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And none of them are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.61,0:33:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid this was a national crisis,\Nbut no, luckily it was just a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.65,0:33:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.56,0:33:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it really was a national crisis,\NI wouldn't want someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.63,0:33:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignore his babbling!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.01,0:33:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.93,0:33:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.21,0:33:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes\Nto kill someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.01,0:33:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, when do you think a person dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.45,0:33:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a bullet from a pistol\Npierces his heart? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.59,0:33:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's attacked by an\Nincurable disease? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.75,0:34:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he eats a soup of deadly\Npoisonous mushrooms? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.35,0:34:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man dies when people forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.65,0:34:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I should disappear right\Nnow, my dream will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.39,0:34:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it does, the citizen's sickness\Nof the heart will be cured as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.93,0:34:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.11,0:34:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.03,0:34:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true for a country?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.17,0:34:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if the will to do it is passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.19,0:34:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.47,0:34:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.65,0:34:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very shortly, a monster will be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.09,0:34:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.39,0:34:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.07,0:34:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.17,0:34:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mushroom won't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.17,0:34:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had a marvelous life!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.33,0:35:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.73,0:35:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.67,0:35:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He blew himself off!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.97,0:35:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.39,0:35:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.89,0:35:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.43,0:35:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.34,0:35:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.57,0:35:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.48,0:35:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.89,0:35:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't even defeat me,\Nyou can't possibly defeat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.37,0:36:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for those who had the\Nnerve to laugh at Hyruleuk's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.59,0:36:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without enough strength,\Nyou'd only die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.53,0:36:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.11,0:36:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice it for this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.49,0:36:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.79,0:36:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.35,0:36:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.33,0:36:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.81,0:36:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only man who cared\Nenough to try to cure
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.11,0:36:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this sick country has just\Ndied while you laughed!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.01,0:36:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even while everyone else\Njust gave up in despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.23,0:36:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this kind doctor attempted to\Nsave us all and died for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.59,0:36:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if someone like that dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.49,0:36:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen the path this\Ncountry should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.97,0:36:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should just die out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.27,0:36:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as we stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.15,0:36:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can't be rebuilt, because\Neven if medical care progresses,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.85,0:36:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if medical research goes on,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.05,0:36:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there is no medicine that can cure fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.25,0:37:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let you have your say, and all\Nyou've done is make me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.23,0:37:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.27,0:37:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to be a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.27,0:37:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to teach me\Nhow to become a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.67,0:37:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.58,0:37:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll become the all-purpose medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.51,0:37:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll become a doctor\Nwho can cure anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.81,0:37:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even cure a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.43,0:37:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you ask of me,\Nbut I've got to become a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.19,0:37:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I know there's no disease, no\Nillness in this world that can't be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.35,0:37:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.65,0:37:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.13,0:37:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.09,0:37:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.71,0:37:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.87,0:38:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for the last six years, Chopper's\Nbeen studying medicine under you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.43,0:38:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I taught him everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been a good student.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.73,0:38:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ean! Dr. Ean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.35,0:38:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ean! There's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.01,0:38:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waffle is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.01,0:38:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.19,0:38:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.53,0:38:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy with the annoying mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.89,0:38:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have returned, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.25,0:38:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, at long last, we\Nshall restore Drum Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.81,0:38:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waffle, sir, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.43,0:38:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.37,0:38:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that strange flag\Nflying? It's an outrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.71,0:38:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the flag of the Drum Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.25,0:38:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old thing, I burned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.95,0:39:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Kureha, the last survivor of\Nour Doctor Hunt, get out of my castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.23,0:39:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This castle is no longer yours, Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.89,0:39:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It saw enough corruption and\Nmisery during your reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.89,0:39:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.85,0:39:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just here, the country too!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.93,0:39:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drum Kingdom has already died out, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.41,0:39:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.91,0:39:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.91,0:39:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is mine!

